### Current Work – A Closed Loop That Runs Today



**REU 2025-26 closed-loop vision system for fused filament fabrication**

```
[ Camera sees the print ]  (RGB, nozzle + build area)
          │
          ▼
[ Model detects ]  (7 defect classes | YOLO11-S, 32–36 ms)
          │
          ▼
[ Confirms across several frames ]  (2–4 consecutive hits)
          │
          ▼
〈 Critical defect? 〉  (clog · layer shift · spaghetti)
   │               │
  NO              YES
   │               │
   ▼               ▼
[ Change the setpoints ]       [ Emergency stop ]
(nozzle temp · flow · speed · bed)  (M112 — no correction attempted)
(M104 · M221 · M220 · M140)
   │
   └──────► (next layers)

```

*End to end: 0.21 – 0.27 s from defect appearing to command reaching the printer*

