### Real-time Behaviour



**Measured link by link, not end to end only**

* **32–36 ms:** Model inference per frame


* **21–26 FPS:** Continuous frame processing


* **20–40 ms:** OctoPrint command dispatch


* **0.21–0.27 s:** Defect appearing $\rightarrow$ command reaching the printer



#### Why the latency budget matters for FA 4



> Closed-loop quality control is a control problem before it is an AI problem. A correction that arrives after the next layer is deposited has no effect. This budget is the discipline FA 4.2.4 will need at line scale, demonstrated here at machine scale.
> 
